// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// MUSIC-CATEGORY-TAGGER — a Rathji template-based tool
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//
// Paste a raw audio file list (PowerShell Get-ChildItem, ls -la, or plain
// newline-separated filenames), set a base URL, and this tool generates:
//   1. `audioTracks`  — a native 2-space indented Perchance list. Every track
//      node exposes title, file, type, mood and tags.
//   2. Filtered selectors — calmBackgroundList, townExplorationList,
//      dungeonAmbientList and stingerFanfares, built with inline
//      .filter() + .selectOne syntax.
//   3. A copy-ready HTML5 <audio> player with Play/Pause, Skip, Volume,
//      pool switching and fallback error handling.
//
// Categorization is driven by the editable keyword dictionaries below.
// Tweak a list and the tool picks it up immediately.
//
// More generators by Rathji: https://perchance.org/rathjis-generators
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

// ── TEMPLATE TO-DO LIST ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Feature checklist for this template. Tick items off (remove the line) as
// they're implemented in index.html.
//   ✓ Multi-line file-list textarea
//   ✓ Base URL input
//   ✓ 4-axis keyword-tagging heuristics (type / mood / environment / profile)
//   ✓ Clean + normalize + camelCase key generation
//   ✓ audioTracks hierarchy with title / file / type / mood / tags
//   ✓ Filtered selectors (.filter() + .selectOne)
//   ✓ HTML5 player scaffolding with error handling + controls
//   ✓ Copy Perchance code / Copy player buttons (dark mode UI)
//   ✓ Live player preview + sample data
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

$meta
  title = music-category-tagger
  description = Paste any audio file list and generate a Perchance audio engine: a categorized audioTracks list, filtered selectors (calm/town/dungeon/stingers) and a copy-ready HTML5 player. A Rathji template-based tool.
  image = https://user.uploads.dev/file/aa7250fc42621385853b2eff967d012b.jpg
  tags = rathji, music, audio, tagger, categorize, soundtrack, tool, generator, perchance, helper, template
  header
    mode = minimal

// ── 1. HEURISTIC KEYWORD DICTIONARIES ──────────────────────────────────────
// These lists power the categorizer. Add/remove words freely — matching is
// whole-word and case-insensitive, so "town" won't match "Townswatch".

// Usability type — skip first, then strongest signal wins.
audioHeurSkip
  harsh
  noise
  screech
  abrasive
  static
  distortion
  feedback
  grating
  shriek
  squeal
  scraping
  glitch
  broken
  test
  scratch
  detuned
  offkey
  off-key
  silence

audioHeurStinger // strong stinger signals
  fanfare
  sting
  stinger
  jingle
  pickup
  item
  catch
  game over
  gameover
  level up
  levelup
  level clear
  stage clear
  victory
  success
  complete
  reward
  coin
  treasure
  quest
  chime
  ding
  boop
  blip
  beep
  alert
  unlock
  transition
  win
  defeated
  cleared

audioHeurStingerWeak // only count if the track has no loop keywords
  get
  open
  clear

